  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.2,
      318.52,
      451.16,
      355.0
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 19 of the Pradeshiya Sabhas Act, No. 15 of 1987(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of this sectionas amended is to enable Pradeshiya Sabhas to spend any part of the Pradeshiya Sabha Fundfor development activities in estate settlements.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.2,
      366.28,
      451.18,
      402.76
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3 : This clause amends section 33 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof this section as amended is to enable Pradeshiya Sabhas to construct and maintain roadsand other common amenities in the plantation regions upon adoption of a special resolutionand in concurrence with the administrative authority of the relevant estate.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
